      "id": "PW HRC Amendment",
      "title": "HRC Amendment - Amends Sec. 6-103 - CC",
      "summary": "Amends Section 6-103 of the Home Rule Charter of the City of New Orleans (Ordinance No. 30553 M.C.S.) on spending against the adopted operating budget. It would bar allotments, reallotments or transfers of budgeted operating funds, and the approval of any requisition, purchase order, voucher or check, that would cause or are reasonably expected to cause spending in any category to exceed the amount appropriated for the year unless the budget ordinance is first amended to reflect the increase. It would also require monthly expenditure reports to the City Council.",
